{"version":1,"key":"card:456","content":{"id":456,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"执行字符串，这样做可能带来严重的安全隐患。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"ebffc07f-e055-4443-85db-a2aaf37691c4","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"exec","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d823ac53-11bb-46b9-8046-95f91a895c2a","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"text":"动态地执行字符串中的 Python 代码，并且可以在运行时生成、修改和执行代码","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"2c4c6c4e-0680-4da9-931b-55a1a502bac8","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":">>> exec(\"print('Hello, world!')\")\nHello, world!","collabId":"9fd19f0f-e921-4aa9-824f-b264f760b5a9","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"32c51a32-f249-47b8-bd6e-5dc0588a76c6","language":"py","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"3b2cea46-ebe1-412f-a2e0-f2b0162d36cb"},{"children":[{"text":"大多数情况下需要向它传递一个命名空间（用于放置变量的地方）；否则代码将污染你的命名空间","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"c21c86de-eca5-4086-b318-2013fe434ea8","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":">>> from math import sqrt\n>>> exec(\"sqrt = 1\")\n>>> sqrt(4)\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"<pyshell#18>\", line 1, in ?\n    sqrt(4)\nTypeError: object is not callable: 1","collabId":"482f62f2-9d7b-40c6-8f9b-d733c3043c78","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"f4b393cc-64d1-4e45-bf9d-772fbb6c197e","language":"py","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"35eb492c-679e-4324-a087-cedf9d6217d2"},{"children":[{"text":"第二个参数是一个字典，用作代码字符串的命名空间","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"64125a1e-b1f9-407a-86d3-69f9245d8260","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":">>> from math import sqrt\n>>> scope = {}\n>>> exec('sqrt = 1', scope)\n>>> sqrt(4)\n2.0\n>>> scope['sqrt']\n1","collabId":"089da860-c041-4e37-8b4f-aa79ecb160de","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"02f2f725-32be-4217-8265-035e6688d27d","language":"py","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"a5ec9e35-2338-417e-ad8a-214408f6d1d4"},{"children":[{"text":"eval","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"1a7df2bb-046d-40ce-b80c-142029ea1edc","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"eval","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 计算用字符串表示的 Python 表达式的值，","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"并返回结果","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"5318b293-1f07-4db0-acdb-2018775edf67","color":"red","colorSelectOpen":false,"lineType":"solid","tauContract":"88d9b3835432080ad1c02f70cd42c22df8b46febe5e2b08b10394f654a84380a","type":"underline"},{"text":"（","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"exec","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 什么都不返回，因为它本身是条语句）。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"7c9afc49-2934-43ea-b556-6ce4d4b6834f","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":">>> eval(input(\"Enter an arithmetic expression: \"))\nEnter an arithmetic expression: 6 + 18 * 2\n42","collabId":"0e08fb0b-d46c-4ce6-aba6-7bf97ecd6a0a","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"co